#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.static_iter.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.static\\_iter"
msgstr "cuda.tile.static\\_iter"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_iter:1 of
msgid "Expand an iterable during compilation."
msgstr "在编译期间展开可迭代对象。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_iter:3 of
msgid "Can only be used as the iterable of a `for` loop::"
msgstr "仅可用作 ``for`` 循环中的可迭代对象： ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_iter:8 of
msgid ""
"The surrounded expression is evaluated using the same rules as "
":py:func:`static_eval`: it can reference global and local variables, and "
"use the full Python syntax, but must not perform any run-time operations."
msgstr ""
"所包裹的表达式会按照与 :py:func:`static_eval` 相同的规则进行求值：它可以引用全局变量和局部变量，并可使用完整的 "
"Python 语法，但不得执行任何运行时操作。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_iter:12 of
msgid ""
"The expression must return a Python iterable, whose length must not "
"exceed some pre-defined number of iterations (currently, 1000). Before "
"any further processing is done, the contents of the iterable are saved to"
" a temporary list, and each item is checked to be valid, as if it were a "
"result of a :py:func:`static_eval` expression (i.e., it must be a "
"supported compile-time constant value or a proxy object for a dynamic "
"value such as a tile)."
msgstr ""
"该表达式必须返回一个 Python 可迭代对象，且其长度不得超过预设的最大迭代次数（当前为 "
"1000）。在进行进一步处理之前，可迭代对象的内容会先保存到临时列表中，并逐项检查其有效性，就像检查 :py:func:`static_eval`"
" 表达式的结果一样（即每一项都必须是受支持的编译期常量值，或是诸如 Tile 等动态值的代理对象）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_iter:19 of
msgid ""
"Finally, for each item of the iterable, the loop body is inlined, with "
"the induction variable(s) bound to the item. Loads, stores, and "
"arithmetic in the body retain their runtime semantics, subject to "
"compiler optimization. The `break`, `continue`, and `return` statements "
"are not allowed inside a `static_iter` loop."
msgstr ""
"最后，对于可迭代对象中的每一项，循环体都会被内联展开，且归纳变量（induction "
"variable）会绑定至当前项。循环体内的加载、存储和算术运算保留其运行时语义，并由编译器进行优化。 ``static_iter`` "
"循环内部不允许使用 ``break`` 、 ``continue`` 和 ``return`` 语句。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_iter:43 of
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

